      "message": "Not exactly true. Vendors can also use init.rc to turn on/off writeback_limit_enable.\n\nI understand you want a single sysprop to control the writeback limit.\nThen how about making property WRITEBACK_RATE_DAILY writable (without ro.)?\nIf vendors set WRITEBACK_RATE_DAILY \u003d 0, then turn off the writeback limit.\nIt also allows vendors change the budgets without rebooting.\nWDYT?",
